WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:05.400
Do not place excessive trust in your retinue or become a puppet danced on their strings.

00:05.680 --> 00:13.500
You and your elder brother are true family—and this realm shall ever belong to the Sikong clan!

00:14.280 --> 00:15.500
Your son understands.

00:16.240 --> 00:17.500
Go now.

00:18.160 --> 00:20.500
Your son takes his leave.

00:36.040 --> 00:37.200
Prince of Jin.

00:39.680 --> 00:41.000
Miss Chen.

00:42.000 --> 00:46.400
What a coincidence. On my granduncle's orders, I was just heading to report to His Majesty.

00:46.640 --> 00:51.600
I have uncovered the truth behind Qing Province—someone was deliberately framing the Prince of Ning.

00:52.960 --> 00:55.800
Could it be Miss Chen has already uncovered the culprit?

00:56.240 --> 00:58.800
Indeed. Drag him forward for His Highness to see!

01:01.120 --> 01:04.200
His name is Guo Xuan, son of the Governor of Qing Province.

01:04.600 --> 01:10.600
The canal obstruction and the riots were orchestrated entirely behind the scenes by him and his father.

01:10.960 --> 01:17.500
Tomorrow, the Chancellor will submit an official memorial of impeachment to bring the Guo family to justice!

01:18.400 --> 01:21.200
(A third-rank provincial governor, discarded merely to serve as a scapegoat...)

01:21.400 --> 01:27.000
(The Chen clan spared no expense to clear Eldest Brother's name. How should I answer her?)
